https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/de/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_purple.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">全新战斗入场效果</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新形象</div></div><div style=\"position:relative; margin-top:5px\"><div style=\"position:absolute; top:-2px; user-select:none; pointer-events:none;\"><img alt=\"Chatacterskinviewtextbg blue.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/233px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"233\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png/350px-Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/95/Chatacterskinviewtextbg_blue.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"36\" /></div><div style=\"margin-left:27px;position:relative;\">崭新单品</div></div></div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">可用角色：</span><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3118\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E6%97%A5\" title=\"命名日\"><img alt=\"Bgequip5.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/100px-Bgequip5.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/150px-Bgequip5.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9b/Bgequip5.png/200px-Bgequip5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E6%97%A5\" title=\"命名日\"><img alt=\"命名日\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-311801.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/b/b7/HeadIconSmall-311801.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%91%BD%E5%90%8D%E6%97%A5\" title=\"命名日\">命名日</a></span></span></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">实装版本：</span>3.7</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:3em\">来源：</span>活动</div></div><div><div><span class=\"color-darkgold\" style=\"margin-right:1em\">所属系列：</span>生死诘问</div></div><div><div class=\"grey-small test-hide hide-m\">编号ID：311803</div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E7.AA.97.E4.B8.AD.E4.BE.A7.E5.86.99_Garment_Display\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"窗中侧写_Garment_Display\">窗中侧写<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">Garment Display</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"infopad\">很久很久以前，在橡树叶尚未落下的时候，人们就已学会了运用语言，并借以解释万物：蛇象征混乱与重生；晨星是命运的纽带；燕子是春日与上帝的使者，将神圣的话语送入你的灵魂。<br />“因此我们得赐传递这话语的权利，为从尘世的幸福中辨认出同行者。”<br />一群孩子认真倾听着，他们中的一个比旁人明白得更多。他惊惶地注视着手里变化的树枝，了解到名字便是定义，赋予姓名便是捕获无形之物的暴力。<br />离乡时他试图向这片永恒的雪地追问一个答案。为什么一切会这样发生，而不是别的样子？如此突然，且不可抵挡——这就是“生活”吗？<br />列昂尼德·阿纳托涅维奇·别利亚科夫。白桦树俯身向他，燕子的翅膀飞掠而过，疑问的答案是另一个疑问。对你来说这是一个怎样的故事？你准备用何种词汇为它命名，宣告它的终结或是开始？<br />雪沉默地落下。</div><div id=\"崭新单品\"></div><h2><span id=\".E5.B4.AD.E6.96.B0.E5.8D.95.E5.93.81_All-new_Item\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"崭新单品_All-new_Item\">崭新单品<small style=\"color: grey\"> <span style=\"display:inline-block\">All-new Item</span></small></span></h2><div class=\"char-item-box0 tabber\"><div class=\"char-item-box1 tabber-item\" data-skinid=\"311803\"><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311804.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/5c/Belonging-311804.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">野草堆中的金针<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">The Needle in the Haystack</div></div></div><div><img alt=\"利齿子儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/62/Value-2.png/27px-Value-2.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"利齿子儿\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" style=\"vertical-align: text-bottom\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/62/Value-2.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"36\" data-file-height=\"24\" />366<hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>一柄适用于仪式性时刻的漂亮工艺品，传说中可匿藏灵魂的锋利造物，标示着每个想停留的瞬间。<br />通过搬运伏特加酒桶，帮助捎带包裹和巧妙运用狩猎技巧，最终受访者如愿以偿地在小摊上买下了它。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311805.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/9/92/Belonging-311805.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“真实之血”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"Blood Turned Real\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到60%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>在荒野里长大的孩子总会携有伤疤，这袭礼服很好地使之成为了装饰性的一部分。<br />其上的色彩彰示着无形之物对自身的解释。在被语言描述之后，这是它们色泽鲜亮的墓志铭。</div></div></div><div class=\"char-item-box2\"><div style=\"margin: 0 -20px;\"><div class=\"char-item-img\"><img alt=\"Belonging-311806.png\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d1/Belonging-311806.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"484\" height=\"444\" class=\"img-fit\" data-file-width=\"484\" data-file-height=\"444\" /><div class=\"title\">“某个故事”<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"text-wrap:wrap\">\"A Story\"</div></div></div><div>无估值<div class=\"grey-small\" style=\"float: right;\">信任达到100%解锁</div><hr style=\"margin:6px 0 10px 0; clear:both\" /></div><div>木雕工艺品，在东方友人与同乡的建议下加以修改，愈发生动。<br />动物的足底刻有小小的名字：达尼尔，列昂尼德，卓雅。<br />藉由雕刻，个人的怀念与消逝的时间相抗衡。当过去推移得足够久远，记忆便成为一种神话。</div></div></div></div></div><h2><span id=\".E8.A1.A3.E7.9D.80.E6.B5.B7.E6.8A.A5\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"衣着海报\">衣着海报</span></h2><div style=\"display:flex; gap:10px; border:1px solid #b55829; width:fit-content\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 永恒的沉默1.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/89/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%981.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"衣着 永恒的沉默2.jpg\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg/228px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"228\" height=\"325\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg/342px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/98/%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg/456px-%E8%A1%A3%E7%9D%80_%E6%B0%B8%E6%81%92%E7%9A%84%E6%B2%89%E9%BB%982.jpg 2x\" data-file-width=\"1080\" data-file-height=\"1540\" /></a></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "衣着"}], "displaytitle": "<span style=\"display:inline-block\"><span style=\"display: flex;flex-direction: column;\">永恒的沉默 <small style=\"color: grey\">The Deathless Quiet</small></span></span>"}}